sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    actor Operator as CIO or help desk
    participant ZD as Zendesk ticket
    participant Fred
    participant Hub as Insights API
    participant Kiosk as OnlineKiosk broker
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
    participant Audit as Reset audit

    Student->>ZD: Requests password or locked-account help
    Operator->>ZD: Reads complete ticket
    Operator->>Student: Verifies identity independently
    Operator->>Fred: Supplies exact identifiers, ticket, and method
    Fred->>Operator: Presents exact ten-minute-link action
    Operator->>Fred: Explicitly confirms
    Fred->>Hub: prepare_entra_password_reset
    Hub->>Kiosk: Signed timestamp, nonce, and exact request
    Kiosk->>Kiosk: Verify caller, HMAC, time, nonce, and role
    Kiosk->>Entra: Match name, 800 number, username, and eligibility
    alt Unique active eligible student
        Kiosk->>Audit: Record assisted-link issue
        Kiosk-->>Fred: Single-use ten-minute URL
        Operator-->>Student: Provides approved private link
        Student->>Kiosk: Opens link and chooses private password
        Kiosk->>Entra: Reset password and issue one-use pass
        Kiosk->>Audit: Record result without secrets
        Kiosk-->>Student: Confirmation and next sign-in step
    else Disabled, ineligible, or no unique match
        Kiosk->>Audit: Record denial without secrets
        Kiosk-->>Fred: No account changed; escalate for review
    end
